        "id": 1273086
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-06T17:57:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reference board brox does not directly support FPMCU at this point.  I wanted to leave room for that to happen, if the need arises.  Also, don\u0027t want to place preference on one OEM device vs. another.",
      "parentUuid": "674a9151_068cffac",
